~ start

PLUM: It's a closet. (neutral) [screen=P_Closet]

- Get in
	$> increment_choice("get_in")

	match get_choice_count("get_in")
		when 1
			PLUM: I'm in the closet! (silly) [screen=P_ClosetIn]
			VINCENT: Stop messing around. (angry)
			PLUM: You can't just force a girl out of the closet. (worried)
			=> END

		else
			PLUM: I've been forced out of the closet. (sad) [screen=P_Closet]
			=> END

- Try on some clothes
	You try on some clothes. [screen=P_ClosetClothes] 
	=> END